    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d610">

                <pb facs="0749" n="641" sameAs="frus:frus1893/pg641"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Gresham to Mr. Terrell.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1893-07-07"><hi rendition="#italic">July 7,
                        1893</hi></date>.</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 18.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I inclose a copy of a letter from Mr.
                    Judson Smith with reference to the statement of Mr. Thompson’s No. 82 of 27th
                    April last, that an <hi rendition="#italic">iradé</hi> would be given,
                    guaranteeing protection and immunities to the college at Marsovan. The
                    Department would be pleased to know what progress has been made in that
                    regard.</p>
                <p>I am, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">W. Q. Gresham.</hi></signed></closer>


                <xi:include href="d610-a1.xml" xpointer="d610-a1"/>
